--- !u!1001 &5300000200
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 8276731506047425992}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 47988600166616349, guid: e4160907936849c4c81dfebe8db680b9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: body
      value: 'Float: hold Jump while falling. Your gravity drops to 1/6 of normal
        (roughly the Moon compared with Earth), your fall is capped at 2 m/s, and
        it lasts 1 second per jump.

        Floating never lifts you: it slows your
        fall, so you stay in the air longer and travel further. A jump alone crosses
        about 4.9 m; with float, about 9.6 m. You just crossed 5.5 m from the lift.

        Your
        abilities work in mid-air too: floating gives you time to aim a Burst or
        a Tether.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 47988600166616349, guid: e4160907936849c4c81dfebe8db680b9, type: 3}
